-- Seed data: real decision-router (Jev) verdicts, anonymised.
-- Generated from 110 run files; 1375 rows; 2026-09-25 to 2026-10-19 (IST).
-- Kept: area, question type, generic verdict label, score, confidence, model, rubric_only, timestamp, opaque run ref.
-- Stripped: every question, instruction, input, name, company, price and free-text label.
-- Choice labels that named a person, brand or amount are NULL. Rows with a NULL created_at came from files with no reliable date.
-- For yes_no rows the API returns a probability, not a confidence: score = P(yes), verdict = yes if P >= 0.5, confidence = NULL.

